# Optional: server/build-only GitHub token to increase the public API rate limit.
# Use an expiring fine-grained token limited to simtropolis/made, Contents: read-only.
# For Amplify, configure RELEASES_GITHUB_TOKEN in the existing app's main-branch
# environment override. This is separate from Made's AMPLIFY_REBUILD_WEBHOOK secret.
# No environment variables are required for local development or public API builds.
# Never use a NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix or export the whole environment into a file.
# RELEASES_GITHUB_TOKEN=
